        <exercise id="_9b88a133-7601-4a81-aaf9-41c2a596d0a0" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00013">
            <para id="para-00115">Are the solutions and the graph for the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> similar?</para>
            <para id="para-00116">Multiple Choice:</para>
            <para id="para-00117">They are not similar.</para>
            <para id="para-00118">They are similar because the solutions are close.</para>
            <para id="para-00119">They are not similar because the square root of a number is always positive.</para>
            <para id="para-00120">They are similar because the square root of a number is always positive.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00013">
            <para id="para-00121">Correct! They are similar because the solutions are close. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9.123</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.877</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
            <para id="para-00122">Try again. Revisit activities 9.5.3 and 9.5.4.</para>
            <para id="para-00123">The correct answer is: They are similar because the solutions are close. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9.123</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.877</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_1dd47cdf-1502-4859-b8b9-851a99c3e986" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem id="prob-00014">
            <para id="para-00124">Answer the following questions about <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
            <para id="para-00125">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> by completing the square.<emphasis>Select two</emphasis> exact solutions.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00014">
            <para id="para-00126">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math></para>
            <para id="para-00127">Try again. Revisit activity 9.5.2.</para>
            <para id="para-00128">The correct answers are: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
